	(gr_text "FAB NOTES:\n1. FINISH: HASL LEAD FREE, ALTERNATE ENIG OK\n2. SOLDERMASK: WHITE\n3. SILKSCREEN: BLACK\n4. LAYERS: 2\n5. TOP AND BOTTOM WEIGHT: 1OZ\n6. INNER LAYERS WEIGHT: 1OZ\n7. TRACE/SPACE: 6MIL/6MIL\n8. MINIMUM DRILL: 0.3MM\n9. FINISHED THICKNESS: 1.6MM\n10: CONTROLLED IMPEDANCE: NO\n11. ITAR: NO\n12. BOARD DIMENSIONS: 90MM x 90MM\n\nASSY NOTES:\n1. CLASS 2 ASSEMBLY\n2. LEAD-FREE SOLDER\n3. DO NOT POPULATE REFERENCE DESIGNATORS THAT ARE MARKED IN THE BOM AS DNP.\n4. J7, J9, J10, J13-J21 ARE PRESS-FIT.  DO NOT SOLDER.\n5. POLARITY MARKERS\n    - PIN 1 IS MARKED BY A DOT, TRIANGLE, BEVEL, OR SQUARE PTH PAD\n    - POSITIVE TERMINAL FOR POLARIZED CAPACITORS IS INDICATED BY A '+' SYMBOL\n    - CATHODE TERMINAL FOR DIODES AND LEDS IS INDICATED BY A CLOSED SILKSCREEN END\n6. IF OUTDOOR USE IS REQUIRED, CONFORMAL COAT ACRYLIC CA3002 OR EQUIVALENT, AFTER Q1 AND STRIKER WIRE ARE INSTALLED.\n   MASK AREAS INDICATED BY COLOR AREAS ON LAYERS F.CCmask and B.CCmask"
